  "description": "For riders who know what they want. The Motus derailleur gives you crisp, confident shifting across the board. Control when you want it, ease when you need it. Powered by Bosch’s Performance Line motor with 75Nm of torque and a 500Wh battery, it makes hard rides feel suspiciously easy. It’s as quiet as it is capable — which is saying something. We’ve refined the frame, too. It’s lighter, neater, and sleeker than the last one. We’ve taken what worked and made it better. Full mudguards, integrated lights, and a rack that’s happy carrying the weight of your day. Ready when you are, and then some. All the best bits of cycling, minus the hassle. No traffic, no sweaty hills, no overthinking. Just get on and go - to work, to the shops, out of town for no reason at all. You start finding excuses to take the long way home. And somehow, being on time becomes your new habit. Range Calculator Use this calculator to better estimate the range you might achieve based on your riding conditions: Bosch Ebike Calculator (Please check the specification to ensure your select the correct motor and battery. The total travel distance will depend on the capacity of the battery, rider and luggage weight, power mode setting and riding style.) Important Please be aware that this bike is regulated in line with existing Electric Power Assisted Cycles regulations. Any modification to the bike will invalidate the guarantee and in particular any modification which increases the power of the motor and/or the top assisted speed of the bike may make the rider liable to prosecution. Excluding statutory obligations Raleigh will not be held responsible for any injuries incurred following any modification to this product.",
